# Grill first

Before creative work in this repo — a new metric, a chart, a page change, an ingest or
automation change — do not run the `brainstorming` skill. Use the `grill` skill in
`.cursor/skills/grill/SKILL.md` instead.

The repo owner has asked to be challenged rather than walked through a collaborative
design ceremony: a few sharp questions up front, no spec document or approval gate
unless the change is genuinely large.

Typing `/brainstorm` still switches to the collaborative mode when something warrants it.
